{"id":"We0d7266e1dbea8eaeb41c091","zh":"空间等参单元","en":"","name":"空间等参单元","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"We0d7266e1dbea8eaeb41c091","text":"空间等参单元","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S4c362dcdf04a00dfd3a6","source_id":"P123","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"在TTS 统一分析模型中,混凝土结构主要由板单元及空间等参单元模拟 [7],其损伤刚度矩阵及更新方法如下。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S1657eb9291b4720e9b19","source_id":"P140","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"基于有限单元法, 可分别采用梁、板、实体及空间等参单元等模拟轨道结构中的钢轨、轨道板、充填层、底座板等空间实体及路、桥、隧等基础结构。","citations":[{"source_id":"P140","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S1c63ca6e0d7b580b397a","source_id":"P140","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"此外,路桥结构的模拟研究相对较多;隧道结构有限元建模工作相对较少,笔者结合有限元和无限元方法, 给出了空间等参单元模式下的隧道空间结构模拟方法,见文献[6]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P140","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"sources":{"P123":{"id":"P123","title":"铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part II:混凝土车致疲劳损伤与空时演化","authors":"徐磊,余志武","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220389","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-ii-train-induced-conc"},"P140":{"id":"P140","title":"铁路列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part I:动力学模型构造与求解","authors":"徐磊","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220719","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-model-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-i-the-dynamics"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"实体结构的离散单元，本文以8节点形式说明刚度更新。","language":"zh","source_id":"P123","paper_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-for-railway-tr